{"id":178,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"自由と責任を重んじる女子学院中高","feature_description":"女子学院は、制服や細かな校則に縛られず、生徒の自主性を尊重する自由な校風が特色です。キリスト教精神を基盤に、6年間一貫の学びと聖書の時間を設け、生徒会やクラブ活動など自発的な学校生活を大切にしています。自由は責任を伴うという考え方も、学校の教育理念に明示されています。また、生徒会や班活動が活発で、学校生活そのものを自分たちで形づくる文化があります。班活動や行事も生徒が担い、責任ある自由を実践しています。","clubs":[{"id":3117,"name":"硬式テニス","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.joshigakuin.ed.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3118,"name":"軟式テニス","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.joshigakuin.ed.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3119,"name":"卓球","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.joshigakuin.ed.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3120,"name":"バレーボール","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.joshigakuin.ed.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3121,"name":"バスケットボール","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.joshigakuin.ed.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3122,"name":"ダンス","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.joshigakuin.ed.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3123,"name":"数楽","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.joshigakuin.ed.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3124,"name":"天文","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.joshigakuin.ed.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3125,"name":"落語研究","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.joshigakuin.ed.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3126,"name":"マンドリンギター","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.joshigakuin.ed.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3127,"name":"YWCA","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.joshigakuin.ed.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3128,"name":"聖歌隊","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.joshigakuin.ed.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3129,"name":"美術","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.j